      "description": "The meme references the concept of 'everybody loses his shit' — a colloquial expression for intense public outrage or reaction — which is a real-world social phenomenon. This is used to contrast the mild reaction to a child's actions with the intense reaction to an adult's similar actions.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
